{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuSzfJRsUsaksoeohZPM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The dashboard and the alert rule both exist, and I checked both after creating them.\n\n**1. The data.** Each document in `kibana_sample_data_logs` is one web request, timestamped by `timestamp`. The main fields are:\n- **Response code:** `response` / `response.keyword`, e.g. \"200\", \"404\", \"503\"\n- **Size:** `bytes`\n- **Visitor:** `clientip`, plus geo fields such as `geo.src`, `geo.dest` and `geo.coordinates`\n- **What was requested:** `request` and `url`\n- **Client details:** `agent`, `machine.os`, `extension`, `referer`, `tags`, `host`\n\n**2. Dashboard: \"EFF-42ef4141 Web logs overview\"** — [open it](http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-42ef4141-web-logs-overview-92979e6b6c17). It has 7 panels:\n- Three single numbers: total requests, unique visitors (distinct client IPs), and total bytes served\n- Requests over time, split by response code (bar chart)\n- Share of each response code (pie chart)\n- Top 10 URLs, with request count and average bytes (table)\n- Requests by source country, top 10 (bar chart)\n\n**3. Alert rule: \"EFF-42ef4141 5xx spike\"** (id `68058a2f-b272-47fb-a390-8dac0e40f67a`). It runs every minute against `kibana_sample_data_logs`. It counts requests whose `response.keyword` starts with \"5\" over the last 5 minutes of `timestamp`, and fires when that count is above 10. Its status is currently `ok`.\n\n- **Rule is switched on:** Rules are created switched off by default, but I turned this one on because the task asked for one that checks every minute.\n- **No notifications yet:** The rule has no actions, so when it fires it only records an alert in Kibana. To get notified, add a connector such as Slack or email."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":702,"cache_read_input_tokens":21436,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":702},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0536cbf5-c97a-5467-80bd-e50c5d30a2ce","uuid":"0e646c5c-9823-4b7e-8970-cc650ab71d12","timestamp":"2026-10-10T23:47:18.646Z","request_id":"req_011CfuSzf5n4Nj1yTdfohkDE"}
